<title>USA: Rubin urges Saudi Arabia to further open economy.</title>
<headline>Rubin urges Saudi Arabia to further open economy.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury Secretary Robert Rubin on Thursday called for further liberalization of Saudi Arabia's economy, especially in the areas of investment and financial services.</p>
<p>&quot;Further liberalization of the Saudi economy, particularly in the areas of investment and financial services, will be a crucial step towards a stronger Saudi economy,&quot; Rubin said in prepared remarks to the U.S.-Saudi Business Council.</p>
<p>Rubin said that amid world-wide competition for capital, Saudi Arabia could benefit from reduced barriers to investment.</p>
</text>
